{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PeakPals</strong> is a vertical climbing game where your goal is simple: <strong>reach the airship waiting at the very top</strong>.<br>But with 2500 meters of platforms, one mistake can send you all the way back down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddfb Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A massive 2500-meter level</strong> \u2013 every meter counts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different platform types</strong> \u2013 including sound-cued falling platforms that keep you on edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements</strong> \u2013 progress milestones across Easy, Medium &amp; Hard difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoint system \u2013 Easy mode gives you a checkpoint every ~100m, Medium every ~500m</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard mode</strong> \u2013 zero checkpoints, pure skill and endurance</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beginner (Easy)</strong> \u2013 forgiving, frequent checkpoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medium</strong> \u2013 balanced challenge with fewer checkpoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard</strong> \u2013 no checkpoints at all. Only the best will survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the patience, precision, and nerves of steel to conquer 2500 meters of chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fall will test your willpower, every jump brings you closer to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh, rage, repeat\u2026 until you finally reach the airship at the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960540/e